{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45124","headline":"往丹阳寻陆处士不遇 · 皎然","name":"往丹阳寻陆处士不遇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远客殊未归，我来几惆怅。\n叩关一日不见人，绕屋寒花笑相向。\n寒花寂寂徧荒阡，柳色萧萧愁暮蝉。\n行人无数不相识，独立云阳古驿边。\n凤翅山中思本寺，鱼竿村口望归船。\n归船不见见寒烟，离心远水共悠然。\n他日相期那可定，闲僧着处即经年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}